      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5692759481854339288, guid: 0481337676de41745bfcc95a304256d8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: "Predictably, the choking little fish stumbles and falls. The fact that
        it\u2019s even attempting this proves its stupidity. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5692759481854339288, guid: 0481337676de41745bfcc95a304256d8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'texts.Array.data[1]'
      value: And The Koi loses any modicum of progress it may have made, obviously.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5692759481854339288, guid: 0481337676de41745bfcc95a304256d8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'texts.Array.data[2]'
      value: One has to wonder whether it realizes its pathetic body is not made
        for this challenge.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
